# --- Reference material -------------------------------------------------
# Books live on disk only. They are copyrighted works and are never
# committed or redistributed. What ships is the curated index in
# books/README.md.
*.pdf
*.epub
*.mobi
*.azw3
*.djvu
*.chm

# --- Secrets and credentials --------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.ovpn
id_rsa*
credentials
secrets.*

# --- Obsidian ------------------------------------------------------------
# Notes are authored in a separate Obsidian vault and copied in by hand.
# If a vault folder ever lands here, its local state must not follow.
.obsidian/
.trash/

# --- OS and editor noise -------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# --- Course write-ups pending release ------------------------------------
# Write-ups for course challenges whose official solutions are not yet
# released are kept on local disk only, and published once the course
# releases them. Technique notes under notes/ are NOT affected.
/course/class-02-web/*.md
!/course/class-02-web/README.md
